sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Alice as Sender (Alice)
    participant ClientA as Browser A (Alpine.js Chat Component)
    participant WS as ChatConsumer (ws/chat/c/<id>/ or /dm/<id>/)
    participant Channels as Channel Layer Group (chat_<id>)
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant ClientB as Browser B (Alpine.js Chat Component)
    actor Bob as Recipient (Bob)

    Alice->>ClientA: Types message & presses Enter (or clicks Send)
    ClientA->>WS: JSON: {"type": "chat_message", "message": "Hello team!"}
    
    WS->>WS: Validate Authentication & Channel Access
    WS->>DB: Save Message(sender=Alice, channel/conv, content="Hello team!")
    DB-->>WS: Message Saved (id, created_at)
    
    WS->>Channels: group_send("chat_<id>", type="chat_message_broadcast", payload={...})
    
    par Broadcast to Sender
        Channels-->>WS: Message Broadcast Payload
        WS-->>ClientA: JSON: {"type": "new_message", ...}
        ClientA-->>Alice: Appends message to stream, scrolls to bottom
    and Broadcast to Peers
        Channels-->>WS: Message Broadcast Payload
        WS-->>ClientB: JSON: {"type": "new_message", ...}
        ClientB-->>Bob: Appends message, plays incoming chime / shows unread badge
    end
